{"id":"e17f40587f032600","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-FS-strength.md","title":"FS等强于有限迭代真理且弱于KF","display":"thm-FS-strength — FS等强于有限迭代真理且弱于KF","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-FS-strength","aliases":["91-thm-FS-strength","91-thm-FS-proof-theoretic"],"display":"thm-FS-strength — FS等强于有限迭代真理且弱于KF","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-FS-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-FS-strength</span><span>91-thm-FS-proof-theoretic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-FS-strength — FS等强于有限迭代真理且弱于KF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-FS-strength-—-FS-等强于有限迭代真理且弱于-KF\">thm-FS-strength — FS 等强于有限迭代真理且弱于 KF</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (标准 FS 与标准全归纳 KF)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> (有限层与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下分层真理)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (共同的算术后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>\n(算术后果等强与严格包含)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>FS 的 capture/release 规则可在任一有限证明中对应有限次分层真理迭代；\nKF 的全真理语言归纳则支持一直到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下的迭代分析。\n因此标准算术强度方向是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}&lt;\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}&lt;\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span>，不是相反。</p>\n<p>经典外层逻辑、是否承认 gap、规则形式等语义或公理风格不能单独决定\n证明论强度。精确比较必须固定理论版本和后果语言；这里比较的是算术\n后果，而非所有含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公式的直接包含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-FS-strength-—-FS-等强于有限迭代真理且弱于-KF","text":"thm-FS-strength — FS 等强于有限迭代真理且弱于 KF","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}<\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"ccf84662da3832c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.m